## 2. Data Flow Diagram - Agent Deployment

```mermaid
graph LR
    USER["👤 User<br/>alice@co.com"]
    
    USER -->|1. Submit Deploy<br/>AGENT_DEPLOY_PROD| AGENT["🤖 Agent<br/>Service"]
    
    AGENT -->|2. Check<br/>RBAC| RBAC["🔑 RBAC<br/>Service"]
    
    RBAC -->|3. Validate<br/>Permissions| DB1["SQLite<br/>RBAC DB"]
    
    RBAC -->|4. Permission<br/>Allowed| AGENT
    
    AGENT -->|5. Create<br/>Approval| APPROVAL["✅ Approval<br/>Service"]
    
    APPROVAL -->|6. Get Required<br/>Approvers| RBAC
    
    RBAC -->|7. Approvers:<br/>security_reviewer<br/>ci_operator| APPROVAL
    
    APPROVAL -->|8. Notify<br/>Approvers| EMAIL["📧 Email<br/>Service"]
    
    EMAIL -->|9. Approval<br/>Request| APPROVER["👤 Approver<br/>bob@co.com"]
    
    APPROVER -->|10. Approval<br/>Decision| APPROVAL
    
    APPROVAL -->|11. Log<br/>Decision| AUDIT["📋 Audit<br/>Service"]
    
    AUDIT -->|12. Store<br/>Event| PG["PostgreSQL<br/>Audit Log"]
    
    APPROVAL -->|13. Decision<br/>Result| AGENT
    
    AGENT -->|14. Deploy<br/>Agent| K8S["☸️ Kubernetes<br/>Execution"]
    
    K8S -->|15. Store<br/>Code & Logs| S3["📦 S3/GCS<br/>Storage"]
    
    AGENT -->|16. Update<br/>Status| DB2["PostgreSQL<br/>Agent DB"]
    
    AGENT -->|17. Response| USER
    
    style USER fill:#e1f5ff
    style APPROVER fill:#e1f5ff
    style EMAIL fill:#ffe0b2
    style K8S fill:#c8e6c9
```

## 3. Authentication Flow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["User: Login Page"] -->|1. Click Login| B["GitHub OAuth<br/>Redirect"]
    
    B -->|2. Redirect to<br/>github.com| C["GitHub<br/>Authorization"]
    
    C -->|3. User Grants<br/>Permission| D["GitHub<br/>Returns Code"]
    
    D -->|4. Redirect back<br/>with Code| E["OAuth Manager"]
    
    E -->|5. Exchange Code<br/>for Token| F["GitHub API"]
    
    F -->|6. Return<br/>Access Token| E
    
    E -->|7. Get User Info| F
    
    F -->|8. Return<br/>User Data| E
    
    E -->|9. Create Session| G["User Store"]
    
    G -->|10. Session Created| E
    
    E -->|11. MFA Enabled?| H{"Check<br/>MFA"}
    
    H -->|Yes| I["📲 MFA<br/>Provider"]
    I -->|12. Prompt for<br/>TOTP Code| A
    A -->|13. Enter Code| I
    I -->|14. Validate| J{"Valid<br/>Code?"}
    J -->|No| I
    J -->|Yes| K["Issue Tokens"]
    
    H -->|No| K["🎫 Token<br/>Manager"]
    
    K -->|15. Issue<br/>Access Token| L["🎫 access_token<br/>TTL: 15 min"]
    K -->|16. Issue<br/>Refresh Token| M["🎫 refresh_token<br/>TTL: 30 days"]
    K -->|17. Issue<br/>Session Token| N["🎫 session_token<br/>TTL: 24 hours"]
    
    L -->|18. Return Tokens| A
    M -->|18. Return Tokens| A
    N -->|18. Return Tokens| A
    
    style A fill:#e1f5ff
    style K fill:#c8e6c9
    style L fill:#a5d6a7
    style M fill:#a5d6a7
    style N fill:#a5d6a7
```

## 4. RBAC Permission Check Flow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["API Request<br/>******"] -->|1. Extract Token| B["Token Manager<br/>Validate JWT"]
    
    B -->|2. Valid?| C{"Signature<br/>OK?"}
    
    C -->|No| D["❌ 401<br/>Invalid Token"]
    C -->|Yes| E["Decode<br/>Payload"]
    
    E -->|3. Get Claims| F["user_id, roles,<br/>scopes"]
    
    F -->|4. Load User<br/>Roles| G["RBAC<br/>Service"]
    
    G -->|5. Query Permission<br/>Matrix| H["SQLite<br/>RBAC DB"]
    
    H -->|6. Lookup| I["role → resource →<br/>actions"]
    
    I -->|7. Permission<br/>Result| G
    
    G -->|8. Check<br/>Required Action| J{"Action in<br/>Permissions?"}
    
    J -->|No| K["❌ 403<br/>Forbidden"]
    J -->|Yes| L{"Action is<br/>APPROVE or<br/>DELETE?"}
    
    L -->|Yes| M["⚠️ High Risk<br/>Action"]
    M -->|9. Check Scopes| N["api:resource:approve<br/>in token?"]
    N -->|No| K
    N -->|Yes| O["✅ Allowed"]
    
    L -->|No| O["✅ Allowed"]
    
    O -->|10. Log to<br/>Audit Trail| P["Audit<br/>Service"]
    
    P -->|11. Store Event| Q["PostgreSQL<br/>Audit Log"]
    
    O -->|12. Proceed| R["Request<br/>Processed"]
    
    K -->|Log Failure| P
    
    style A fill:#e1f5ff
    style R fill:#c8e6c9
    style K fill:#ffcdd2
```

## 5. Approval Workflow with SLA Escalation

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["Approval Request<br/>Created"] -->|Expires: 5 min| B["L1 Approver<br/>Primary Owner"]
    
    B -->|1. SLA: 4 hours| C{"L1<br/>Response?"}
    
    C -->|Approved| D["✅ APPROVED<br/>Proceed"]
    C -->|Rejected| E["❌ REJECTED<br/>Block"]
    C -->|No Response| F["L1 SLA<br/>Expired"]
    
    F -->|2. Escalate| G["L2 Approver<br/>Secondary"]
    
    G -->|3. SLA: 4 hours| H{"L2<br/>Response?"}
    
    H -->|Approved| D
    H -->|Rejected| E
    H -->|No Response| I["L2 SLA<br/>Expired"]
    
    I -->|4. Escalate| J["L3 Approver<br/>Senior Authority"]
    
    J -->|5. SLA: 4 hours| K{"L3<br/>Response?"}
    
    K -->|Approved| D
    K -->|Rejected| E
    K -->|No Response| L["🤖 Auto-Approve<br/>Quorum Unavailable"]
    
    L -->|6. Auto-Approve| M["✅ Approved via<br/>Auto-Escalation"]
    
    D -->|7. Log Result| N["Audit<br/>Service"]
    E -->|7. Log Result| N
    M -->|7. Log Result| N
    
    N -->|8. Store Event| O["PostgreSQL<br/>Audit Log"]
    
    D -->|✅ Action<br/>Proceeds| P["🎯 Execute<br/>Operation"]
    E -->|❌ Action<br/>Blocked| Q["Block Operation"]
    M -->|✅ Action<br/>Proceeds| P
    
    style D fill:#a5d6a7
    style E fill:#ef9a9a
    style M fill:#a5d6a7
    style P fill:#c8e6c9
    style Q fill:#ffcdd2
```

